• System Admin: BASH, Git;

• Fluent in English;

Added Advantage

• Preferred engineering experiences: MLOps, MATLAB, and Java, Cloud platform experience: Azure and AWS;

• Ability to prototype and evaluate applications and interaction methodologies;

